    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Serving the kuo-toa archpriests, whips (named for the way they keep other kuo-toa in line) lead war bands that carry out their superiors’ orders. In return for their fervor, they receive minor magical gifts and pincer-like weapons for capturing foes. In battle, whips drive the other kuo-toa forward with threats and gurgling chants.</p>",
